# Licenses for RhyRhy English (현서네 리얼 영어)

This project uses a dual licensing model:

1. **Educational Content & Media** (quizzes, bilingual scripts, conversational audio recordings, and learning materials) are licensed under **Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International (CC BY-NC 4.0)**.
2. **Software Source Code** (HTML, CSS, JavaScript, application logic, and build scripts) is licensed under the **MIT License**.

